    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Xenon is a new, retro-themed, console-style RPG downloadable for Windows. Traverse a war-torn land on foot and fly over the highest mountains on the back of a friendly dragon, in your quest to save your friends and prevent an evil sorcerer from plunging the world into eternal darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is recommended for those who have already completed the classic Final Fantasy and Breath of Fire games and are looking for an additional challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 - 40 hour epic adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Party members and multiple classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change classes throughout the story - different classes, different strategies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Encounters! Beware, enemies can attack at any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hidden items to find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional bosses + side quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, quasi 8-bit pixel art graphics and scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control with keyboard, mouse, or Xbox controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulty - Recommended for people who have beaten the classic NES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPGs and are looking for additional challenge!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move/Select : DIRECTIONAL KEYS, LEFT MOUSE BUTTON</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk/Confirm/Interact : Z, ENTER, SPACE, LEFT MOUSE BUTTON</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel/Menu : X, ESC, RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-screen mode toggle : F4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle aspect ratio while full-screen : F3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
